---
import { FontAwesomeIcon } from "astro-fontawesome";
import { faCheckCircle, faWrench } from "@fortawesome/free-solid-svg-icons";
---

<section class="bg-base-100 border-base-300 border-y py-24">
  <div class="container mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 md:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-base-content text-3xl font-bold md:text-4xl">
          Introduction
        </h2>
        <div class="mt-2 flex gap-1">
          <div class="bg-primary h-1 w-12"></div>
          <div class="bg-accent h-1 w-40"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-base-content/80 space-y-4 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            PT Promatcon Tepatguna is a steel fabrication company established in
            1990. PT Promatcon Tepatguna is an EPC (Engineering, Procurement,
            Construction) company that supplies and services Process & Piping
            Equipment, Gas Compressors, and TCP (Turbine Control Panels), as
            well as Retrofits, for the onshore and offshore oil & gas
            industries; renewable energy (geothermal) operating in Indonesia.
          </p>
          <p>
            PT Promatcon Tepatguna also provides design and manufacturing
            services, including mechanical calculations, engineering drawings,
            fabrication, final inspection, and installation of pressure vessels
            in accordance with international standards and specific
            specifications based on the American Society of Mechanical Engineers
            (ASME) Boiler and Pressure Vessel Code Section VIII Div. 1.
          </p>
          <p>
            We have ISO 9001:2015 certified and hold the ASME "U" and "R"
            stamps. All our work follows a quality management system to ensure
            timely delivery, clear documentation, and long-term reliability. Our
            main principle is To provide products and services of high quality
            that fulfill the customers needs as well as to obtain customer
            satisfaction" by continuously innovating and working efficiently.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 pt-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <div class="card bg-base-200 border-base-300 border">
            <div class="card-body p-6">
              <div class="text-primary mb-2 flex items-center gap-3 font-bold">
                <div class="bg-secondary/10 text-secondary rounded p-2">
                  <FontAwesomeIcon icon={faCheckCircle} class="h-5 w-5" />
                </div>
                Process Guarantees
              </div>
              <p class="text-base-content/70 text-sm">
                Rigorous simulation and testing to validate output parameters
                before site deployment.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card bg-base-200 border-base-300 border">
            <div class="card-body p-6">
              <div class="text-primary mb-2 flex items-center gap-3 font-bold">
                <div class="bg-secondary/10 text-secondary rounded p-2">
                  <FontAwesomeIcon icon={faWrench} class="h-5 w-5" />
                </div>
                Mechanical Integrity
              </div>
              <p class="text-base-content/70 text-sm">
                Adherence to highest global standards for material selection and
                fabrication quality.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="rounded-box border-base-300 relative h-[500px] overflow-hidden border shadow-xl"
      >
        <img
          src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuD6Y11XvOGVIfSq5r2AA--jLH7yF7Q_2cjPiOFqPzQNGehL0BK4JOq3-vxHVuk8tjjXcQq-CoKXB9yBRxJTv6wX4Nm5Y6eBvuBC6juIxFZu9Kj-GlWnjwsJlY60xMvwJiQlRL2I03bNHzFOZVRFiJQHX74YhCjjBKR06duh2TkSeG8xN7RftEMpFHWzHCfh9VZAijkQFN3tryvjXi1A7HtZFSaoidkKeERo-AKiKb38aKpFmJCHbJpr"
          alt="Industrial pipes and valves"
          class="h-full w-full object-cover"
        />
        <div class="bg-secondary/10 absolute inset-0 mix-blend-multiply"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
